1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,646
Five things you must do in Eswatini.

2
00:00:03,046 --> 00:00:05,254
Do ride the Malolotja canopy tour.

3
00:00:05,274 --> 00:00:10,057
Ten zip lines and a fifty-meter suspension
bridge cross a mountain gorge.

4
00:00:10,457 --> 00:00:12,216
Do raft the Great Usutu River.

5
00:00:12,236 --> 00:00:16,388
Guides take you through mostly grade three
rapids in a remote stretch.

6
00:00:16,788 --> 00:00:20,412
Do watch the sibhaca dance at Mantenga
Cultural Village.

7
00:00:20,432 --> 00:00:24,271
Dancers kick high and drum twice a day
beside beehive huts.

8
00:00:24,671 --> 00:00:27,294
Do track a black rhino on foot at Mkhaya.

9
00:00:27,314 --> 00:00:30,859
Guides run the walks, and odds are among
Africa's best.

10
00:00:31,259 --> 00:00:33,727
Do sleep in a beehive hut at Mlilwane.

11
00:00:33,747 --> 00:00:36,627
The restaurant there overlooks a hippo
pool.

